The USAC (xHE-AAC) coder tables in `src/aac/usac/tables.rs` (scalefactor
band offsets, TNS max bands, noise-fill start offsets, arithmetic-coder
cumulative-frequency/hash/lookup tables, and MDST estimation filters)
are normative data of ISO/IEC 23003-3 (MPEG-D USAC) as tabulated by
Ittiam's libxaac:

    libxaac
    https://android.googlesource.com/platform/external/libxaac
    Copyright (C) 2018 The Android Open Source Project
    Originally developed and contributed by Ittiam Systems Pvt. Ltd, Bangalore

licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (see
https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0). The
values were extracted from the libxaac decoder sources
(`ixheaacd_arith_dec.c`, `ixheaacd_rom.c`, `ixheaacd_aac_rom.c`,
`ixheaacd_ext_ch_ele.c`) by a generator script and are standardised
tables; see the file header of `tables.rs` for the per-table ISO/IEC
23003-3 clause citations.

The linear-prediction-domain core (`src/aac/usac/lpd/`) is a Rust port of the corresponding
libxaac decoder routines (`ixheaacd_acelp_bitparse.c`, `ixheaacd_lpc.c`, `ixheaacd_lpc_dec.c`,
`ixheaacd_avq_dec.c`, `ixheaacd_acelp_decode.c`, `ixheaacd_acelp_tools.c`,
`ixheaacd_acelp_mdct.c`, `ixheaacd_tcx_fwd_alcnx.c`, `ixheaacd_tcx_fwd_mdct.c` and
`ixheaacd_fwd_alias_cnx.c`) and its tables (`lpd/tables.rs`) were extracted from the libxaac
sources. libxaac is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 as above.

The 24 band analysis filter bank of 8:3 enhanced SBR (`src/aac/sbr/qmf.rs`, `AnalysisQmf24`) and its
window (`src/aac/sbr/qmf24_table.rs`, `esbr_qmf_c_24`) were taken from the libxaac sources
(`ixheaacd_esbr_qmf` routines and tables). libxaac is licensed under the Apache License, Version
2.0 as above.

The MPEG Surround 2-1-2 upmix (`src/aac/usac/mps212/`) is a Rust port of the corresponding libxaac
decoder routines (`ixheaacd_mps_dec.c`, `ixheaacd_mps_decorr.c`, `ixheaacd_mps_hybrid_filt.c`,
`ixheaacd_mps_parse.c`, `ixheaacd_mps_calc.c`, `ixheaacd_mps_smoothing`/`ixheaacd_mps_ecdatapairdec`
and `ixheaacd_mps_huff`) and its tables (`mps212/tables.rs`) were extracted from the libxaac
sources, licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 as above.

