The USAC decoder's behaviour was checked against, and in places follows, the Fraunhofer FDK AAC
codec library (https://github.com/mstorsjo/fdk-aac, "Software License for The Fraunhofer FDK AAC
Codec Library for Android"): the selection of the complex stereo prediction MDST filters and the
values of the previous-frame filters (`mdst_filt_coef_prev`), the downmix and upmix of
`CJointStereo_ApplyMS()`, and the syntax of `fac_data()` and its algebraic vector quantiser
(`CLpd_FAC_Read()`, `CLpc_DecodeAVQ()`). No FDK code is copied; the arithmetic is reimplemented in
floating point. That license grants no patent rights; see the FDK `NOTICE` for its terms.

